pageType: content
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 34, 300, 18]
    content: {style: "$kicker", wrap: false, text: 03 · 系统架构}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 54, 840, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      text: 链上管钱和凭证，链下管文件和查询
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [60, 102, 840, 1]
    viewBox: [840, 1]
    points: "0,0 840,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: arch-img
    elementType: image
    bounds: [70, 116, 330, 386]
    src: media/01-system-architecture.png
    fit: {mode: contain}
  - elementId: pt1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [440, 130, 460, 80]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>前端不经过后端发交易</strong> —— 用户经 MetaMask 直连 Sepolia 合约；后端不接触私钥，只提供 REST 查询与缓存。</p>
  - elementId: pt2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [440, 225, 460, 80]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>发票 PDF 存链下、哈希存链上</strong> —— 确认前人人可校验文件未被篡改，兼顾合规存证与 Gas 成本。</p>
  - elementId: pt3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [440, 320, 460, 80]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>Web3.py 事件监听器持续同步</strong> —— TransferSingle 等事件落到 7 张业务表，支撑仪表盘与审计查询。</p>
  - elementId: pt4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [440, 415, 460, 60]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>五个合约相互调用满足课程要求；Render 托管 Flask 服务。</p>
        <p>图源：docs/designs/diagrams/01-system-architecture.mmd</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 508, 400, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", wrap: false, text: SC6113 · 供应链金融 DApp}
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 508, 40, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: "04"}
